These files were generated under the copyright holder's paid Higgsfield
subscription, whose terms grant the subscriber the rights to the generated
results, including commercial use; the copyright holder licenses them with
the rest of this repository under Apache-2.0. Two honest caveats remain:
whether AI-generated images are protected by copyright at all is unsettled
in many jurisdictions, so the license applies to them only to the extent any
rights exist; and Higgsfield's terms do not allow using generated results to
train models — please do not use these files for that.

